{"yaj": [{"id": "yaj", "headword": "यज्", "headword_slp1": "yaj", "fold": "yaj", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "यज् vi. or vt. 1U (pp. इष्ट; pres. यजति-ते; pass. इज्यते; desid. यियक्षति-ते) 1. To sacrifice, M.xi.40; (often used with the instrumental of the word signifying ‘rite, sacrifice,’ इष्ट्वा च शक्तितो यज्ञैः M.vi.36); 2. to make an oblation to a particular deity, (with acc. of the deity and inst. of the oblation, वाग्दैवत्यैश्च चरुभिर्यजेरंस्ते सरस्वतीम् M.viii.105); 3. to worship.With सम्-, to worship, समयष्टास्रमंडलम् Bt.xv.96.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "yajati": [{"id": "yajati", "headword": "यजति", "headword_slp1": "yajati", "fold": "yajati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "यजति m. A term for those sacrifices to which the verb यजति is applied, as distinguished from those rites to which the verb जुहोति applies. (See M.ii.84 and Medhātithi thereon; Sarvajnyanārāyaṇa renders जुहोति by उपविष्टहोम and यजति by तिष्ठद्धोम.)", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यजतिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yajatiH"]}], "yajatra": [{"id": "yajatra", "headword": "यजत्र", "headword_slp1": "yajatra", "fold": "yajatra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "यजत्र (I) m. A Brāhmaṇa maintaining consecrated fire.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "यजत्र (II) n. The maintenance of such fire.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यजत्रः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yajatraH"]}], "yajana": [{"id": "yajana", "headword": "यजन", "headword_slp1": "yajana", "fold": "yajana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "यजन n. 1. The act of sacrificing; 2. a sacrifice; 3. a place of sacrifice.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यजनं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yajanaM"]}, {"id": "yAjana", "headword": "याजन", "headword_slp1": "yAjana", "fold": "yajana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "याजन n. The act of performing a sacrific